            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.091,
            0.909,
            0.133
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "标。由于 SCE 分析方法比观察染色体畸变更简便、迅速、敏感，并表现出很好的剂量效应关系，因此，目前已把 SCE 列为检测致突变物、致癌物的常规指标之一。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.142,
            0.438,
            0.166
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.177,
            0.911,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 仪器、用具: 超净工作台、恒温培养箱、恒温水浴箱、天平、离心机、恒温水浴箱、2ml 注射器、吸管、量筒、培养瓶、烧杯、酒精灯、载玻片、紫外灯 (15W)、铝饭盒、擦镜纸、玻片架。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.24,
            0.37,
            0.259
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:人外周血。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.261,
            0.259,
            0.279
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.282,
            0.435,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）培养基（配法见实验33）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.304,
            0.911,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）BrdU 液:用无菌青霉素瓶，于分析天平称取 BrdU 2mg，然后在无菌室内加入无菌生理盐水 4ml，即  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "500 \\mu g/ml"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，用黑布遮光，置冰箱中保存，最好现配现用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.347,
            0.62,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）2×SSC溶液（20×SSC贮液的配方见附录2）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.369,
            0.383,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）pH6.8磷酸缓冲液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.39,
            0.418,
            0.408
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40\\mu \\mathrm{g / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 秋水仙素溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.411,
            0.669,
            0.43
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）1mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Na_{2}HPO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  溶液（用稀盐酸调节 pH 至 8.0）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.44,
            0.301,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.474,
            0.778,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 培养基制备、采血及培养过程与人体外周血淋巴细胞培养相同。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.496,
            0.911,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）培养 24h 后加入 BrdU，最终浓度为  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10 \\mu g/ml"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。培养瓶用黑纸包装（避光以防 BrdU 分解）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.539,
            0.911,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）终止培养前 4～6h 加入秋水仙素溶液（40μg/ml）0.05～0.1ml，最终浓度 0.4～0.8μg/ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.581,
            0.636,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）按常规空气干燥法制片，37℃温箱中存放备用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.602,
            0.554,
            0.622
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 姐妹染色单体区分染色，该法有两种。"
